 "strings": {
  "Deliver a Bento to Kaito": "",
  "I should ask him about Yakumaru Loans while I'm at it.": "",
  "Investigate Yakumaru Loans": "",
  "So Yakumaru is yakuza-backed. Maybe Yusuke's dad was taken in, but I'll need to ask around. Wasn't there a loan shark on Tenkaichi Street I could ask?": "",
  "Talk to the Suspicious Man": "",
  "There's a suspicious guy on the street where the Ushimata office is. He matches the description Yusuke-kun gave me of his father.": "",
  "Check in on Kaito": "",
  "I wonder how Kaito-san is doing on this whole security guard thing? Adachi's company address is on his business card in my case file.": "",
  "Gather Intel on Adachi Estates": "",
  "Looks like I need to look into these rumors about Adachi Estates. I should check out Tender and the city's gathering spots.": "",
  "Head to Adachi Estates": "",
  "I need to let Kaito know about these rumors about his new employer. Just in case.": "",
  "Investigate Adachi at Kanrai": "",
  "Looks like I'll get my chance to check out these rumors about Adachi for myself.": "",
  "An Entertainment Job": "",
  "Go to Hotel New Deborah": "",
  "The client is waiting in the sixth floor hallway of Hotel New Deborah in Theater Square. I should go in the day.": "",
  "Go to the Hills Garden": "",
  "This event is being held on a special stage in the Hills Garden on Park Boulevard.": "",
  "Change into Bram-sama's Outfit": "",
  "I need to change into Bram-sama's outfit to draw the attention of the media. Can't say I'm looking forward to it...": "",
  "Run Away from the Media": "",
  "I gotta lose the media and get out of here. But will they just let me go?": "",
  "What does Hoshino-kun mean by \"incident\"? I better check this out.": "",
  "Investigate the Crime Scene": "",
  "Find Ayumu": "",
  "I've gotta find this kid based on a photo his dad sent.": "",
  "Defeat the Tough Guys": "",
  "These guys are just obstructing me for fun. Where in the world is Ayumu-kun?": "",
  "Ask about Hachitani at Bantam": "",
  "I should ask around Bantam where Hinata-san drank with this young woman.": "",
  "Find Asuka Hachitani": "",
  "Hachitani is posting about what she's doing... I can probably find her with that. Or I could ask around the city.": "",
  "Tail Asuka Hachitani": "",
  "Tail Asuka": "",
  "Find the Black Van": "",
  "The man who kidnapped Nanami-san is in a black van. I've gotta find her!": "",
  "The suspect is inside Charles, but we need to do some sleuthing to find out who he might be.": "",
  "Accuse a Culprit": "",
  "I have all the evidence. I just need to corner the culprit!": "",
  "Search for Gamo": "",
  "Gamo is lying low somewhere in Kamurocho. I should look for him.": "",
  "Defeat the Mad Bomber": "",
  "I'm kind of scared of this bomb, but Tsukumo said it's disarmed... right? I can't believe he'd go this far.": "",
  "Defeat Panty Professor": "",
  "Keep your fetishes to yourself, dude. Gross.": "",
  "Capture Ass Catchem": "",
  "Defeat Ass Catchem": "",
  "This pervert is a former athlete, but I think I can take him! You'll never be the best, you pervert!": "",
  "Apprehend Giant Impact": "",
  "Defeat Giant Impact": "",
  "So Giant Impact is some old geezer? Gross. Hopefully he'll go down without too much of a fight.": "",
  "Defeat Oka's Crew": "",
  "So not only did Oka steal the evidence, he wants me out of the way? Yeah right!": "",
  "Defeat the Janitor": "",
  "This woman's crazy. She's even got the janitor at her beck and call.": "",
  "Defeat Saito's Crew": "",
  "I'm gonna get you out of here, Sana-chan!": "",
  "Calm down Deguchi": "",
  "This kid needs to be taught a lesson, and I've got just the fist to teach him.": "",
  "Defeat Inamoto": "",
  "I can't believe this guy tricked me!": "",
  "Rescue Meguro": "",
  "Meguro-san got scammed, so I guess I can bail him out.": "",
  "Defeat Meguro": "",
  "Meguro's losing it. Maybe I can knock some sense into him.": "",
  "Defeat Hiyama": "",
  "An arsonist. We've had enough of those in this city.": "",
  "Chase the Ghost": "",
  "Bust the Ghost": "",
  "Capture the... Hat?": "",
  "Chase the...  Hat?": "",
  "Catch the Child": "",
  "Chase the Child": "",
  "He's got the wrong idea, but being wrong has its consequences sometimes.": "",
  "I guess I'm Captain Cop's sidekick. Better teach Yusuke-kun that justice always prevails.": "",
  "Defeat Kaito": "",
  "This wasn't how I was thinking this would end! Why won't he listen to reason!?": "",
  "Defeat Adachi's Crew": "",
  "These guys need a good old fashioned ass kicking.": "",
  "Defeat Higurashi": "",
  "Higurashi is the lowest of the low. I'll bring him lower.": "",
  "Defeat Shin Amon": "",
  "What a tough guy! I better not let my guard down!": "",
  "Defeat Minami": "",
  "I've gotta defeat him to get the truth, I guess.": "",
  "Defeat Takeda": "",
  "I need to defeat this stalker.": "",
  "Defeat the Punks": "",
  "Looks like today's lesson is pain, and I'm the teacher.": "",
  "Defeat Gamo": "",
  "Wow, he's buff! I better watch it!": "",
  "A Golden Mouse": "",
  "I'm not going down here, guys.": "",
  "Did he really track me down by smell? Either way, I can't lose to him!": "",
  "Defeat Obayashi's Crew": "",
  "These guys don't know when to quit! I need to get after that homeless guy.": "",
  "Defeat Kasai's Crew": "",
  "He's an idiot, but he's strong. I better pay attention.": "",
  "Defeat Honda's Crew": "",
  "All this guy thinks about is fighting. I'll make him regret it.": "",
  "Defeat Koga's Crew": "",
  "If I defeat him and get the cops down here, I can clear the bounty on my head!": "",
  "Defeat the Man in Black": "",
  "Come on guys, I just want this cat. How do I get rid of them?": "",
  "I'll get you off this cat's tail once and for all!": "",
  "Genda's Request": "",
  "Meet the Client at Hotel New Deborah": "",
  "Genda-sensei has a client for me waiting at the south side of the New Deborah lobby in Theater Square.": "",
  "Return to Sushi Gin": "",
  "The purse snatcher bought a cooking knife. I better ask the Sushi Gin guy about Wakahara again.": "",
  "Head to Volcano": "",
  "Apparently Wakahara plays pachinko there often.": "",
  "Search for Wakahara": "",
  "The owner of Sushi Gin said Wakahara tends to be around that pachinko parlor, Volcano.": "",
  "Capture Wakahara": "",
  "Chase Wakahara": "",
  "Defeat Wakahara": "",
  "I knew he was our guy. I've gotta roll him if I want answers about our sashimi, though.": "",
  "Find the Best Vantage Point": "",
  "They'll finish if I take too much time. But I need to get a good angle to really capture the violence.": "",
  "Defeat Miki's Crew": "",
  "A former wrestler and his bodyguards, huh? This could get interesting.": "",
  "Gather Intel From a Sushi Restaurant": "",
  "This guy clearly has some culinary skill. I should ask around some sushi shops.": "",
  "Miyamoto-san is acting strange. I can't just leave her alone!": "",
  "Head to the Beef Zone": "",
  "How dare they take Kim-san hostage just to get to me!? I've literally got an office, guys. I've gotta hurry to Beef Zone on Nakamichi Street!": "",
  "Defeat the Host": "",
  "I need to put this host in his place so I can get the money back from that conniving woman.": "",
  "Kaito-san is working on getting what Ayabe knows. I'll meet them at Tender.": "",
  "A Missing Persons Case": "",
  "My client should be a middle-aged woman with black hair in a blue coat.": "",
  "Women sure love to keep secrets... Now I'm really tired.": "",
  "Defeat the Punk": "",
  "Is this little jerk working for Oikawa?": "",
  "Accept Adachi's Request": "",
  "Search for Azusa Otaki": "",
  "Genda-sensei's client is shopping for clothes. She's probably wherever they sell fashionable stuff.": "",
  "Search for Karin": "",
  "Azusa Otaki's daughter, Karin-chan, has gone missing. It's possible that her former yakuza father kidnapped her, but I should ask around.": "",
  "Return to Genda Law Office": "",
  "I found the client and her daughter. We should lay low at Genda-sensei's office.": "",
  "Head to the Love Hotel": "",
  "If Oikawa really duped this poor woman, I have to find the evidence. The sign in this picture says \"Luna Blue Hotel.\"": "",
  "Get Intel from Sushi Gin": "",
  "I need to convince the owner of Sushi Gin that the culprit could be Wakahara... But I guess I'll need focus on something else for now.": "",
  "Shono visits the patient ward every morning. I should find an infiltration route.": "",
  "Find the Diamond Ring": "",
  "The thief may have sold off the diamond ring. I should check out the pawn shop.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family seems to be playing it safe. Guess I'll have a drink at Tender... totally open to attack.": "",
  "Head to Alvin": "",
  "So this place is Matsugane Family backed, eh? Not too shabby. Is this your doing, Hamura?": "",
  "Head to the Champion District": "",
  "Hamura must be on my tail by now. Maybe if I give him a nice, secluded area like the Champion District...": "",
  "Found the Matsugane Family! Now to make a big enough scene to draw out Hamura.": "",
  "Great, another brawl. Was this really the best plan?": "",
  "Hit Three Matsugane Family Clubs": "",
  "Let's play yakuza telephone, shall we? If I cause trouble at a few places, it's sure to reach Hamura's ears.": "",
  "Head to Millennium Tower": "",
  "What was up with that drone!? Talk about dangerous! I should follow it to the Millennium Tower.": "",
  "Talk to Hattori": "",
  "Do journalists snap all their photos with their phones these days? This guy's still a shady SOB.": "",
  "Find a Lost Pet": "",
  "Go to the Happy Family Rooftop": "",
  "The client is dragging me up to the roof of the Happy Family izakaya on Senryo Avenue. Why such a weird spot?": "",
  "Find Someone Who Knows Cats": "",
  "I'll be looking for a needle in a haystack if I go looking for this cat without any clues. I should get some professional assistance.": "",
  "Head to Taihei Boulevard": "",
  "Zhuang Shi is apparently often seen on Taihei Boulevard. I should head there.": "",
  "The cat went inside. I'm going in.": "",
  "Catch Zhuang Shi's Attention with the Drone": "",
  "These mods should make my drone so it won't go down so easily. Now to get back to that cat!": "",
  "Shoot the Enemy Drone": "",
  "It worked! That felt pretty cool actually.": "",
  "Meet with Higashi": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan is bound to retaliate against the Matsugane Family. This could erupt into a full-scale war. I should hit the streets to find out more.": "",
  "Dice & Cube Completion Bonus": "",
  "Head to M Side Cafe": "",
  "Kiriko Kuwayama works at M Side Cafe. Let's see if I can figure her out.": "",
  "Sit Nearby and Eavesdrop on Kojiro": "",
  "I should listen in on this poor sap's conversation. I need to find a seat close enough that won't arouse suspicion.": "",
  "Chase after Kojiro": "",
  "I need to warn Kojiro-san about that foreign substance in his drink. He should be nearby.": "",
  "Find the Stalker": "",
  "Someone's stalking Kojiro-san. I'll find him.": "",
  "Tail the Stalker": "",
  "Once he ducks into an alley, we'll find out who this guy is.": "",
  "First I'll gather some info at the scene of the crime. If I ask around about the bag, maybe I'll find some clues.": "",
  "Find the Thieves": "",
  "I should find somewhere that young guys might hang out. Maybe some friends would have an idea, too.": "",
  "The bag was tossed in the garbage in the Champion District. Guess I'll go look.": "",
  "Find the Homeless Man": "",
  "Great. Bag, but no jacket. If a homeless guy took it, maybe he'll give it back.": "",
  "Get the Jacket Back": "",
  "The homeless guy doesn't want to give us his source of warmth in the winter, and I can't blame him. But what to do?": "",
  "Give the Homeless Man Warm Clothes": "",
  "Time to trade jackets.": "",
  "Wait for Tsukumo to Call": "",
  "There's nothing you can't buy on the internet these days... When he's done, Tsukumo will contact me. But what to do until then?": "",
  "Enemy Backup": "",
  "I wanted to crash for the day, but the barkeep over at Tender wants me. I guess I'll go see what's up.": "",
  "Find Mari's Secret": "",
  "I'm tailing Mari to see if I can find out her real identity. Hope it works.": "",
  "Head to Kiguchi Real Estate": "",
  "Megumi Hashimoto's husband works at Kiguchi Real Estate on East Shichifuku Street.": "",
  "A Ghostly Request": "",
  "Head to Quadra Garden at Night": "",
  "My client wants to meet me at Quadra Garden at night. Shimazu-san should be wearing a hoodie with a heart.": "",
  "Investigate the Honey Trap": "",
  "Wait for the Client": "",
  "An anonymous client? Who could this be?": "",
  "A Challenge": "",
  "Meet the Client in Little Asia": "",
  "I got a request from a mysterious client titled, \"A Challenge.\" A challenge... What kind of job could this be?": "",
  "Infiltrate Monsieur Lee": "",
  "Is this really Shono's secret lab? No time to waste.": "",
  "Find the Bomb": "",
  "There's a bomb nearby! I can hear it!": "",
  "Yet another bomb! This one's clue is \"The pigeon coos among the cherry blossoms.\"": "",
  "Photojournalist Job": "",
  "Meet with Hiranuma at Beef Zone": "",
  "Hiranuma-san is waiting at Beef Zone for me. I'll head over there when it's dark.": "",
  "Investigate a Daughter-in-law": "",
  "My client should be wearing a pink coat and jeans.": "",
  "Missing Jacket": "",
  "Head to Wild Jackson": "",
  "The client's at Wild Jackson on Tenkaichi Street. He's apparently got brown hair, a gray jacket, and a red shirt.": "",
  "An infidelity case might be a nice change of pace. I'll meet the client at the office.": "",
  "Accept Tsukumo's Package": "",
  "I need to grab a package for Tsukumo from the Poppo on Showa Street. It's a pain, but in the grand scheme, it's not so bad.": "",
  "Deliver Tsukumo's Package": "",
  "I have Tsukumo's anime DVD box set. I probably shouldn't speculate about what this is. He'll be waiting at Mantai.": "",
  "Find Asami at the Poppo on East Shichifuku Street": "",
  "Apparently Morimiya-san is at the Poppo on East Shichifuku Street.": "",
  "Do I report to the client?": "",
  "If I report Asami-san's location to my client, Tanaka-san, I'll be done with the job. But I feel like I'm missing something. Is there anything else I should do first?": "",
  "Find Morimiya-san": "",
  "Tanaka-san was the stalker the whole time! How did I not see it!? I've gotta get back to that Poppo!": "",
  "Go to Showa Street and look for Hiyama": "",
  "This Hiyama guy headed toward Showa Street. What could cause a calamity of fire?": "",
  "Tail Hiyama": "",
  "Chase Hiyama": "",
  "I should check the memo Tatsuro-san gave me so she doesn't realize that I'm an imposter. I can check the memo in the case file.": "",
  "Find the Culprit": "",
  "Shoot down Judge Creep 'n Peep.": "",
  "Shoot Down the Skittering Pervert": "",
  "I have to find this bomb! The hint is \"The Angel in the Warrior's Maze.\"": "",
  "There's another bomb! This time the clue is, \"The Ox in the Inn.\"": "",
  "Talk to Sana Mihama": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
